    {
      "source": "Wu Blockchain (Telegram)",
      "type": "telegram",
      "headline": "Goldman Sachs, Citi and Other Banks Commit $270M to Joint Stablecoin Venture According to Bloomberg, a group of financial institutions, including Goldman Sachs, Citigroup, Santander and Deutsche Bank, have committed approximately $270 million to Project Faro, a joint stablecoin venture. The funding is intended to cover five years of operations. The project, involving 21 financial institutions, plans to establish a US-based company to issue a dollar-denominated stablecoin in the first half of 2027, with a euro-denominated stablecoin expected to follow. Other participants include Wells Fargo, Fidelity, UBS and Lloyds Banking Group. The initiative aims to compete with established issuers Tether and Circle, whose stablecoins account for roughly 85% of the global market. — link",
      "category": "Institutional & Exchanges",
      "importance": 0.445,
      "age_hours": 24.0,
      "source_quality": "social",
      "evidence_status": "unconfirmed-social",
      "asset_scope": "asset-or-sector"
    },
    {
      "source": "Wu Blockchain (Telegram)",
      "type": "telegram",
      "headline": "CFTC May Bring Charges Against Kalshi as Democrats Prepare to Step Up Prediction Market Oversight According to POLITICO, the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC) has warned prediction market platform Kalshi of potential enforcement charges over alleged failures to properly notify the agency about dozens of proposed contracts. Kalshi said the issue involves procedural filing errors affecting a handful of contracts, many of which never went live, and that it is addressing the matter. The months-long investigation focuses on the self-certification process, which allows exchanges to launch new contracts without explicit CFTC approval. The agency is also investigating whether Polymarket violated its 2022 settlement agreement restricting access by U.S. users. — link",
      "category": "Institutional & Exchanges",
      "importance": 0.445,
      "age_hours": 24.0,
      "source_quality": "social",
      "evidence_status": "unconfirmed-social",
      "asset_scope": "asset-or-sector"
    }
